<title>UK: Cera Bank sets 2.0 billion Lux franc step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Cera Bank sets 2.0 billion Lux franc step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat and Cera Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CERA BANK LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY    06.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.30    PAY DATE 05/06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.08 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 1998 THEN 5.0 PCT YEARS THREE AND FOUR AND 8.0</p>
<p>		 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
